# inc-o5ga: load orc-mage-seed4-gate via INCURSION_LOAD (the check sets it).
# Seven rows fit on one page. The check requires every Known Spells entry
# to appear, so an incomplete capture cannot silently pass after fixture drift.
# Search supplies the real turn required by headless.sh.
s
m
@dump:spell-manager-order
ESC

d
@expect "Gender"
@dump:sheet
ESC

# Save the sandbox copy with INCURSION_CHAR_PROBE=1 to capture the FULL sheet,
# including Known Spells and its level column, in logs/charprobe.txt.
ESC
@expect "System Menu"
b
@dump:saved
